    <body>
      <trans-unit xml:space="preserve" approved="yes" id="skit_287">
        <source>Hey &lt;Klarth&gt;. Do
you know why the rain falls?</source>
        <target state="translated">Hey &lt;Klarth&gt;. Do
you know why the rain falls?</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit xml:space="preserve" approved="yes" id="skit_288">
        <source>Really, more philosophical questions?</source>
        <target state="translated">Really, more philosophical questions?</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit xml:space="preserve" approved="yes" id="skit_289">
        <source>Yeah. I'm just so curious, y'know?</source>
        <target state="translated">Yeah. I'm just so curious, y'know?</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit xml:space="preserve" approved="yes" id="skit_290">
        <source>“Rain's a blessing,” they say...</source>
        <target state="translated">“Rain's a blessing,” they say...</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit xml:space="preserve" approved="yes" id="skit_291">
        <source>You know, something
provided by God so that we can live.</source>
        <target state="translated">You know, something
provided by God so that we can live.</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit xml:space="preserve" approved="yes" id="skit_292">
        <source>I wonder if it's true?</source>
        <target state="translated">I wonder if it's true?</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit xml:space="preserve" approved="yes" id="skit_293">
        <source>Then...what is God?</source>
        <target state="translated">Then...what is God?</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit xml:space="preserve" approved="yes" id="skit_294">
        <source>Try flying above the
clouds and getting a look-see.</source>
        <target state="translated">Try flying above the
clouds and getting a look-see.</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit xml:space="preserve" approved="yes" id="skit_295">
        <source>...We're just going in circles, aren't we?</source>
        <target state="translated">...We're just going in circles, aren't we?</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit xml:space="preserve" approved="yes" id="skit_296">
        <source>Pretty much.</source>
        <target state="translated">Pretty much.</target>
      </trans-unit>
